<span class="cs-line cmt"># RL training loop with MTP speculative decoding</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># MTP acceptance length compounds multiplicatively:</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt">#   E[L] = α₁ + α₁α₂ + α₁α₂α₃  (γ=3 heads)</span>
